   "title": "Note",
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Colour & upscale tools\n**Colour Ramp** builds hue-shifted ramps (shadows lean blue-violet, highlights lean yellow) from base colours — feed its `hex` into *PF Palette* (source = hex) to recolour anything with it. **Palette Swap** maps exact colours (team colours, armour tiers). **Hue Shift** recolours in OKLab. **Scale2x/3x** upscale pixel art smoothly without inventing colours."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
